# Slido

> Slido is an audience interaction platform for meetings, presentations, webinars, classrooms, conferences, and company events. It helps hosts run live polls, audience Q&A, quizzes, word clouds, surveys, ideas, and engagement analytics, and it works standalone or inside tools such as PowerPoint, Google Slides, Webex, Microsoft Teams, and Zoom. Slido is part of Webex by Cisco, and this file covers Slido's public marketing site, Help Center and Community, blog, developer/Data API surfaces, and status page. Slido's public pages state that 1.24M+ customers have used Slido, with 8M+ interactive meetings and 240M+ engaged participants.
